---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site';
import { LOCALES } from '../../i18n';

const t = LOCALES.en;
---

<BaseLayout title="About" lang="en">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About {t.siteName}</h1>
    <p>
      Radioactivity is everywhere — in the ground under your house, inside a
      nutshell, at 36,000 feet. And almost everywhere it is either ignored or
      dramatized. {t.siteName} does neither: we explain in plain language,
      with numbers from official sources (EPA, CDC, WHO, and European
      authorities), where radiation and other invisible risks show up in
      everyday life — and when they actually matter.
    </p>
    <p>
      The content is created in the orbit of the radiation protection courses
      of PD Dr. Dirk Schulze. Professionals looking for accredited radiation
      protection training will find it at
      <a href={SITE.kurseUrl} rel="noopener">kurse.dirkschulze.ch</a> — home of
      the free
      <a href={`${SITE.kurseUrl}/flugdosis/`} rel="noopener">flight dose calculator</a>
      and the
      <a href={`${SITE.kurseUrl}/dosisrechner/`} rel="noopener">dose calculator</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is funded by advertising and clearly labeled affiliate links.
      Its content is general information and no substitute for individual
      medical advice.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
